# Vercel project root = web-portal. Production deploys use `vercel build --prebuilt` (see docs/DEPLOY.md),
# so only .vercel/output is uploaded. This file is a safety net for any non-prebuilt `vercel deploy`.
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they never match app routes such as app/[locale]/rules.

# CIS Benchmark PDFs are licensed material: never serve or upload them, wherever they are.
*.pdf
/benchmarks
/rules-staging
/../benchmarks
/node_modules
/.next/cache
/.git
/*.zip
/*.tar.gz
/*.exe
/bin
/screenshots
/public/releases
